{"seq":35,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1369"},"reason":"The falsetto B-flat in 'Bohemian Rhapsody' is Roger Taylor's, not Mercury's (Mercury's documented falsetto is on 'Somebody to Love'); Axl Rose is a bass-baritone known for extreme range, not a documented falsetto. Body sentences fixed accordingly; notes explain the card's loose grouping and accept 'high voice / extreme vocal range'.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bohemian_Rhapsody"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Somebody_to_Love_(Queen_song)"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Axl_Rose"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neil_Young"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",116],["-","slid"],["+","rose"],["=",11],["-","„Bohemian Rhapsody“ and "],["=",54],["-","Roses"],["+","Roses,"],["=",1],["-","alternates"],["+","by"],["=",1],["-","between"],["+","voice"],["=",1],["+","type "],["=",2],["-","rasping"],["+","bass-baritone,"],["=",1],["-","baritone"],["+","leaps"],["=",1],["-","and"],["+","from"],["=",1],["-","a"],["+","low"],["=",1],["+","growls to "],["=",2],["-","falsetto"],["+","high"],["=",1],["-","shriek"],["+","shrieks"],["=",810]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",116],["-","„Bohemian Rhapsody“ und "],["=",62],["-","Roses"],["+","Roses,"],["=",1],["-","wechselt"],["+","stimmlich"],["=",1],["+","ein Bassbariton, springt "],["=",14],["-","zwischen"],["+","von"],["=",1],["-","einem"],["+","tiefem"],["=",1],["-","rauen"],["+","Knurren"],["=",1],["-","Bariton"],["+","zu"],["=",1],["-","und"],["+","durchdringend"],["=",1],["-","einem"],["+","hohen"],["=",1],["-","durchdringenden"],["+","Schreien."],["=",1],["-","Falsett-Schrei. "],["=",795]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",100],["-","песнях"],["+","песне"],["=",3],["-","«Bohemian Rhapsody» и "],["=",56],["-","Roses"],["+","Roses,"],["=",1],["+","по типу голоса бас-баритон, "],["=",16],["-","чередует"],["+","перескакивает"],["=",1],["-","хриплый"],["+","от"],["=",1],["-","баритон"],["+","низкого"],["=",1],["-","с"],["+","рычания"],["=",1],["-","пронзительным"],["+","к"],["=",1],["-","фальцетным"],["+","пронзительному"],["=",1],["-","визгом."],["+","высокому"],["=",1],["+","визгу. "],["=",747]]},{"field":"notesEn","diff":[["+","The card's expected answer is falsetto. Of the three, Freddie Mercury's falsetto is the best documented; Neil Young is known above all for his high tenor and Axl Rose for his extreme range, so \"high voice\" or \"extreme vocal range\" is also accepted."]]},{"field":"notesDe","diff":[["+","Die erwartete Antwort der Karte ist Falsett. Von den dreien ist Freddie Mercurys Falsett am besten belegt; Neil Young ist vor allem für seinen hohen Tenor bekannt, Axl Rose für seinen extremen Stimmumfang, daher werden auch „hohe Stimme“ oder „extremer Stimmumfang“ als richtig gewertet."]]},{"field":"notesRu","diff":[["+","Ожидаемый ответ карточки — фальцет. Из троих фальцет Фредди Меркьюри задокументирован лучше всего; Нил Янг известен прежде всего высоким тенором, а Эксл Роуз — огромным диапазоном, поэтому ответы «высокий голос» или «огромный диапазон» тоже засчитываются."]]}],"hash":"cdff487d5df5","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"f0aba1cbc69b3aeda41614c819f42f87210b0612c9f5c49eb96cf876e9a4a5ee"},
